{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301440","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230144001:1":{"text":"そんなに分かりやすかった？もうちょっと抑えないとな。","source_cn":"有这么明显吗？那我要收敛一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C35FFAC61B0D1E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230144002:1":{"text":"家族にバレたら、今度は別の仕事を探せって言われちゃうからね。","source_cn":"不然被家里人发现，他们一定又要催我去找找别的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47F0171D95612C58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230144003:1":{"text":"家族は僕が海に出たいかどうかなんてどうでもいいんだ。お金が稼げるから、僕に船乗りになれって言ってるだけなんだよ。","source_cn":"家里人根本不在意我喜不喜欢出海，只要能挣钱，就逼我上船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53F49801376EAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230144004:1":{"text":"僕を陸に留めてくれてる霧には感謝しないとね。","source_cn":"感谢海上的大雾，让我有机会重返陆地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC529064CB2CCB5E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民奥特":{"text":"町民のオルト","source":"镇民奥特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}